    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Mixed by the dozen and sold in plain vials with a white label.</p><p>As a Bonus Action, you can use a vial of Basic Poison to coat one weapon or up to three pieces of ammunition. A creature that takes Piercing or Slashing damage from the poisoned weapon or ammunition takes an extra 1d4 Poison damage. Once applied, the poison retains potency for 1 minute or until its damage is dealt, whichever comes first.</p><section id=\"secret-YwO5GX35V4XweNWL\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes a roll for the Poison damage.</p></section>",
